{"chars": "That is the great secret of reindeer flight. To us, the northern lights look like beautiful ribbons of color in the sky. But to Santa's reindeer, they are a road, a glowing path they can feel tingling through their hooves, and they run along it, up and up, into the sky. Even in places where people can't see the northern lights at all, far to the south, or in the bright daytime, the auroral road is still there, faint and hidden, the way the stars are still in the sky during the day even though we can't see them. The reindeer can always feel it. And with their special eyes, perhaps they can even see it.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.388, 0.388, 0.388, 0.525, 0.525, 0.525, 0.525, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 1.312, 1.312, 1.312, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 2.575, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 3.3, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.875, 3.875, 3.875, 3.875, 3.875, 3.875, 3.875, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.412, 4.412, 4.412, 4.412, 4.412, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.825, 5.825, 5.825, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 6.013, 6.013, 6.013, 6.013, 6.8, 6.925, 6.925, 6.925, 6.925, 7.075, 7.075, 7.075, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 8.075, 8.15, 8.15, 8.15, 8.15, 8.15, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.4, 8.4, 8.512, 8.512, 8.512, 8.512, 8.512, 9.125, 9.225, 9.225, 9.325, 9.325, 9.325, 9.325, 9.325, 9.325, 9.325, 9.325, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 10.037, 10.037, 10.037, 10.037, 10.037, 10.15, 10.15, 10.15, 10.15, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11